### task.assigned explanation [POST]
Approximately around 60-45 mins before the slot time chosen for collection, Orange Health system will assign the task to a nearest available emedic.
On successfull assignment from our end, task.assigned will be triggered for each patient as follows.

For the sake of testing/documentation, slot time has been changed to the nearest available slot going forward.

