### test.completed_not_sent explanation [POST]
This event is triggered for each patient when the respective test is completed from Orange Health's end, but the reports is not shared due to some reasons.
Common reason would be if payment is not completed. 

However, it is also an intermediatery state, which means for orders that are paid, this will be triggered and immediately the next status will also be triggered.

Please note, if 1 patient has multiple tests, this event will be triggered as and when each of the tests are completed individually

