### Cancellation [POST]
The above was an optimistic flow with order completion, however, if the order is cancelled once placed with Orange Health, order.cancelled will be triggered for each patient respectively.

If the order is cancelled before task.confirmed is reached, only order.cancelled will be triggered.
But if the order is cancelled after task.confirmed, along with order.cancelled, task.deleted will be triggered as well.

The examples for both can be found below


